<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-month T-bill auction lowest price of 99.87.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-month T-bill auction lowest price of 99.87.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.3 trillion yen</p>
<p>of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the</p>
<p>following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.87   Stop rate     0.5   pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.874  Average yield 0.484 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   3.93781  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.29987  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 10.2051 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 June 20, 199</p>
<p>Maturity	   Sept 22, 1997</p>
</text>
